SUMMARY:THE UPBEAT BEATLES
DESCRIPTION:TICKETS: Adults £23\, Concessions £20\n\nWith their powerhou
 se vocals\, precision harmonies and tight musicianship\, the Upbeat Beatle
 s are second to none.  The guys have an easy\, happy rapport with any cro
 wd\, winning them an enviable reputation as the best in the business.  Th
 ere’s no band to touch them – eight bars into Twist and Shout and you
 ’ll know why: no one else performs that song like the Upbeat Beatles!\n\
 nThe show takes you through the long and winding road from the early Caver
 n days through Beatlemania\, America\, Sergeant Pepper to Abbey Road\, wit
 h narrative and full multimedia presentation.  If you love the Beatles\, 
 you’ll love this show\, and even if you don’t love the Beatles\, you
 ’ll love this show!\n\n&nbsp\;
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://regaltheatre.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/IM
 G_0059.jpeg
END:VEVENT
