DESCRIPTION:TICKETS: Adult £10\, Child £6\, Family of 4 £25\n\nMatinee o
 n Saturday 3rd at 2.30 pm\n\nDisney Channel’s smash hit movie comes to l
 ife on the stage! Troy\, Gabriella and the students of East High must deal
  with issues of first love\, friends and and family while balancing their 
 classes and extra curricular activities.\n\nMads and Oasis proudly present
  High School Musical: Live on Stage!  A fun filled show for the whole fam
 ily.  Come along and sing along to the well-known and much-loved songs yo
 u know and enjoy.  Mads and Qasis are inclusive theatre companies\, welco
 ming people from all walks of life and giving everyone the opportunity to 
 perform and shine.
